 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Find dry spot under the blanket and get a bit of electric heat. A small portable is best if you can find it in the dark. Sure, I' get them. Pack it and get it inside before you leave, so it' ready for tomorrow. Then light candles and turn off lights. Find the tent door and follow the trail down. Keep low under any headlights and stop everyone now and check they' got their shoes. Get inside and keep the candles burning. Then pack and leave for tonight's hotel, or whichever one you decided on beforehand.",
